 "segments": [
  {
   "start_ms": 6000,
   "end_ms": 9060,
   "text": "Your Takafumi, my sister's kid."
  },
  {
   "text": " But where is, uh... everyone else?",
   "end_ms": 13080,
   "start_ms": 9180
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 16200,
   "end_ms": 19020,
   "text": " Well, our family had a huge falling out because of you."
  },
  {
   "text": " What to do with you while you were in a coma, and let me tell you, it wasn't cheap.",
   "end_ms": 23340,
   "start_ms": 19140
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 25800,
   "text": " My mom said.",
   "start_ms": 23880
  },
  {
   "text": " She didn't want to see you.",
   "end_ms": 27540,
   "start_ms": 26280
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 31800,
   "end_ms": 34500,
   "text": " Ikura's Kura."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 37680,
   "end_ms": 38460,
   "text": " Okay."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 38580,
   "end_ms": 39000,
   "text": " Huh?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 41640,
   "text": " I'll prove Gran Bahamal is real.",
   "start_ms": 39120
  },
  {
   "text": " Uh, you really don't...",
   "end_ms": 44760,
   "start_ms": 41700
  },
  {
   "text": " Whoa, Grant Zeld.",
   "start_ms": 45480,
   "end_ms": 47100
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 50220,
   "end_ms": 50760,
   "text": " Okay."
  },
  {
   "text": " Margret Magna.",
   "start_ms": 51360,
   "end_ms": 53760
  },
  {
   "text": " Margren Rand?",
   "start_ms": 56880,
   "end_ms": 58440
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 58560,
   "end_ms": 60120,
   "text": " This is... What?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Just sad.",
   "end_ms": 60540,
   "start_ms": 60180
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 62340,
   "text": " What we got?",
   "start_ms": 60660
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 62460,
   "end_ms": 63840,
   "text": " Walkman Pat?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 64800,
   "text": " Hey, Uncle.",
   "start_ms": 63960
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 65099,
   "end_ms": 65760,
   "text": " Lutch."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 65820,
   "end_ms": 67500,
   "text": " Money has been a little tight lately?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh, Grant...",
   "start_ms": 67560,
   "end_ms": 69060
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 69120,
   "text": " So I brought some documents for you to sign.",
   "end_ms": 70680
  },
  {
   "text": " And after that, they're going to send you somewhere to help you get back.",
   "end_ms": 74460,
   "start_ms": 70740
  },
  {
   "text": " Wait on your feet.",
   "start_ms": 74820,
   "end_ms": 75300
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 75360,
   "text": " Carrie.",
   "end_ms": 76020
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 86520,
   "text": " What the hell?",
   "start_ms": 85200
  },
  {
   "text": " Wind, return it.",
   "end_ms": 88620,
   "start_ms": 86700
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 90120,
   "end_ms": 91620,
   "text": " Of course."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 91740,
   "end_ms": 92820,
   "text": " It's Japanese here."
  },
  {
   "text": " That's all real.",
   "end_ms": 108900,
   "start_ms": 107880
  },
  {
   "text": " Hold on, now.",
   "start_ms": 110460,
   "end_ms": 112260
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 112320,
   "end_ms": 115320,
   "text": " Did you just say you were sending me away somewhere?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 116640,
   "text": " Nope, I didn't.",
   "start_ms": 115380
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 118260,
   "text": " Yeah, sure.",
   "start_ms": 116760
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 118320,
   "end_ms": 119100,
   "text": " Yeah, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 119160,
   "end_ms": 119580,
   "text": " So what was that?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 120420,
   "start_ms": 119640,
   "text": " Hmm..."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 121740,
   "text": " It's magic.",
   "start_ms": 120600
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 121860,
   "text": " Fire.",
   "end_ms": 123300
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 125760,
   "start_ms": 123720,
   "text": " Whoa, awesome."
  },
  {
   "text": " Wait.",
   "start_ms": 125880,
   "end_ms": 126540
  },
  {
   "text": " How are you doing that?",
   "start_ms": 126660,
   "end_ms": 127320
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 128580,
   "text": " That's nothing.",
   "start_ms": 127380
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 131220,
   "start_ms": 128639,
   "text": " I want to know if Sega won the console wars."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 131280,
   "text": " Huh?",
   "end_ms": 131880
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 133680,
   "start_ms": 132000,
   "text": " Seiga?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 134040,
   "end_ms": 135000,
   "text": " Now?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 135120,
   "end_ms": 139920,
   "text": " Well, these days, Sony and Nintendo are the biggest console makers."
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "start_ms": 139980,
   "end_ms": 140880
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 140940,
   "end_ms": 141840,
   "text": " No Sega?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Is this important?",
   "start_ms": 141960,
   "end_ms": 143760
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 144960,
   "text": " Sega.",
   "start_ms": 143820
  },
  {
   "text": " Well, they, uh, stopped making consoles.",
   "start_ms": 145080,
   "end_ms": 148560
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 151980,
   "text": " The Kurus Kurora.",
   "end_ms": 154620
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 154980,
   "end_ms": 158760,
   "text": " Hey, Uncle, what's ikuras cuoram mean?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 158820,
   "end_ms": 160020,
   "text": " Oh."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 160380,
   "end_ms": 162180,
   "text": " It's a memory erasing spell."
  },
  {
   "text": " So I can forget sad things.",
   "start_ms": 162300,
   "end_ms": 164520
  },
  {
   "text": " Sega was that important?",
   "end_ms": 167580,
   "start_ms": 165120
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 170940,
   "text": " There were a lot of sad times in Gran Bahamo.",
   "start_ms": 167640
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 171000,
   "text": " Wanna see?",
   "end_ms": 171900
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 173640,
   "text": " Uh, yeah.",
   "start_ms": 171960
  }
 ],
